OL,3,ARussian strikes hit key power plant in
OL,4,AKyiv, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key energy facility supplying Kyiv
OL,7,Fwith heating and electricity has been
OL,8,Fhit in a Russian ballistic missile
OL,9,Fattack, Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky has said.
OL,12,FDarnytska CHP-4, or CHPP-4, and a
OL,13,Fresidential building were hit in a
OL,14,Fstrike the president said came with "no
OL,15,Fearly warning from our partners".
OL,17,FKyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko said one
OL,18,Fperson was killed and 13 injured in the
OL,19,Fmissile strike on the apartment block
OL,20,Flate on Tuesday. Four people were in a
OL,21,Fserious condition, he said.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
